#: selfdrive/selfdrived/alerts_offroad.json
msgid "<b>Unsupported branch detected</b> - The current version of <b><u>%1</u></b> branch is no longer supported on the comma three. Please go to <b>[Device > Software]</b> and install a supported branch with <b><u>-tici</u></b> in the branch name for the comma three."
msgstr "<b>检测到不支持的分支</b> - 当前版本的 <b><u>%1</u></b> 分支在 comma three 上不再支持。请前往 <b>[设备 > 软件]</b> 并安装分支名称中包含 <b><u>-tici</u></b> 的支持分支。"

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/developer.py
msgid "<b>WARNING: sunnypilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and may disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, sunnypilot defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of sunnypilot's longitudinal control. Enable this to switch to sunnypilot longitudinal control. Enabling Experimental mode is recommended when enabling sunnypilot longitudinal control alpha. Changing this setting will restart sunnypilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "<b>警告：sunnypilot 縱向控制在此車型上處於 Alpha 階段，可能會停用自動緊急制動（AEB）。</b><br><br>在此車型上，sunnypilot 預設使用車輛內建的 ACC，而非 sunnypilot 的縱向控制。啟用此項可切換到 sunnypilot 縱向控制。啟用 sunnypilot 縱向控制 Alpha 時，建議同時啟用實驗模式。若車輛已通電，變更此設定將重新啟動 sunnypilot。"

